@model Entertania1.ViewModels.Venue.VenueCreateViewModel
@inject IConfiguration Configuration
@using Core.Enums
@using Core.Helpers

@{
    ViewData["Title"] = Model.VenueId == 0 ? "Create Venue" : "Edit Venue";
    var governorates = GovernorateHelper.GetGovernorateList(includeArabic: true);
}
<link rel="stylesheet" href="~/css/Venue/VenueCreate.css" />

<div class="container mt-4">
    <div class="row">
        <div class="col-md-8 offset-md-2">
            <div class="card shadow">
                <div class="card-header bg-primary text-white">
                    <h3><i class="fas fa-building"></i> @ViewData["Title"]</h3>
                </div>
                <div class="card-body">
                    <form asp-action="@(Model.VenueId == 0 ? "Create" : "Edit")" method="post" enctype="multipart/form-data" id="venueForm">
                        <input type="hidden" asp-for="VenueId" />
                        <input type="hidden" asp-for="GoogleMapsUrl" id="googleMapsUrl" />

                        <div class="mb-3">
                            <label asp-for="Name" class="form-label">Venue Name</label>
                            <input asp-for="Name" class="form-control" placeholder="e.g., Cairo Opera House" />
                            <span asp-validation-for="Name" class="text-danger"></span>
                        </div>

                        <!-- ✅ Governorate Dropdown with Validation -->
                        <div class="mb-3">
                            <label asp-for="Governorate" class="form-label">
                                <i class="fas fa-map-marked-alt"></i> Governorate / المحافظة
                                <span class="text-danger">*</span>
                            </label>
                            <select asp-for="Governorate"
                                    class="form-select select2-governorate"
                                    id="governorateSelect"
                                    required>
                                <option value="">-- Select Governorate --</option>
                                @foreach (var gov in governorates)
                                {
                                    <option value="@gov.Key" selected="@(gov.Key == (int)Model.Governorate)">
                                        @gov.Value
                                    </option>
                                }
                            </select>
                            <span asp-validation-for="Governorate" class="text-danger"></span>
                            <div id="governorateValidation" class="mt-2" style="display: none;">
                                <div class="alert alert-warning alert-sm mb-0">
                                    <i class="fas fa-exclamation-triangle"></i>
                                    <span id="validationMessage"></span>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <small class="text-success" id="autoDetectSuccess" style="display: none;">
                                <i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i> Auto-detected from map location
                            </small>
                        </div>

                        <div class="mb-3">
                            <label asp-for="Location" class="form-label">Address</label>
                            <input asp-for="Location" class="form-control" placeholder="e.g., 1 Opera Square, Gezira" />
                            <span asp-validation-for="Location" class="text-danger"></span>
                        </div>

                        <div class="mb-3">
                            <label asp-for="Capacity" class="form-label">Capacity</label>
                            <input asp-for="Capacity" class="form-control" type="number" min="1" placeholder="e.g., 1000" />
                            <span asp-validation-for="Capacity" class="text-danger"></span>
                        </div>

                        <hr class="my-4" />

                        <div class="mb-3 position-relative">
                            <label class="form-label">
                                <i class="fas fa-search"></i> Search for Location
                            </label>
                            <div class="input-group">
                                <input type="text" id="placeSearch" class="form-control" placeholder="Type venue name or address...">
                                <button type="button" id="useMyLocation" class="btn btn-outline-primary">
                                    <i class="fas fa-location-arrow"></i> Use my location
                                </button>
                            </div>
                            <div id="searchResults" class="list-group position-absolute w-100 shadow-sm" style="z-index:1000; display:none;"></div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="row">
                            <div class="col-md-6 mb-3">
                                <input asp-for="Latitude"
                                       class="form-control"
                                       id="latitudeInput"
                                       placeholder="e.g., 30.0444"
                                       step="0.000001"
                                       type="hidden" />
                            </div>

                            <div class="col-md-6 mb-3">
                                <input asp-for="Longitude"
                                       class="form-control"
                                       id="longitudeInput"
                                       placeholder="e.g., 31.2357"
                                       step="0.000001"
                                       type="hidden" />
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="mb-3">
                            <label class="form-label">
                                <i class="fas fa-map-marker-alt"></i> Select Location on Map
                                <span class="text-muted">(Click to place marker)</span>
                            </label>
                            <div id="map" style="height: 450px; border-radius: 8px; border: 2px solid #dee2e6;"></div>
                            <small class="text-muted d-block mt-2">
                                <i class="fas fa-info-circle"></i>
                                Click anywhere on the map to set venue location. Governorate will be auto-detected instantly.
                                <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-link" onclick="centerMapToEgypt()">
                                    Reset to Cairo
                                </button>
                            </small>
                        </div>

                        <hr class="my-4" />

                        <!-- MEDIA UPLOAD (Same as before) -->
                        <div class="card mb-3">
                            <div class="card-header bg-info text-white">
                                <h5><i class="fas fa-photo-video"></i> Venue Media</h5>
                            </div>
                            <div class="card-body">
                                <div class="alert alert-info">
                                    <i class="fas fa-info-circle"></i>
                                    <strong>Media Guidelines:</strong>
                                    <ul class="mb-0 mt-2">
                                        <li>Upload up to 10 photos (JPG, PNG, WEBP, GIF, BMP - Max 20 MB each)</li>
                                        <li>Upload up to 5 videos (MP4, WEBM, MOV, MKV, AVI - Max 250 MB each)</li>
                                    </ul>
                                </div>

                                <div class="mb-3">
                                    <label for="photoInput" class="form-label">
                                        <i class="fas fa-images"></i> Select Photos
                                    </label>
                                    <input type="file" name="photos" id="photoInput"
                                           accept="image/jpeg,image/png,image/webp,image/gif,image/bmp"
                                           multiple class="form-control" />
                                </div>
                                <div id="photoPreview" class="row g-3 mt-2" style="display: none;"></div>

                                <hr class="my-3" />

                                <div class="mb-3">
                                    <label for="videoInput" class="form-label">
                                        <i class="fas fa-video"></i> Select Videos
                                    </label>
                                    <input type="file" name="videos" id="videoInput"
                                           accept="video/mp4,video/webm,video/quicktime,video/x-matroska,video/x-msvideo"
                                           multiple class="form-control" />
                                </div>
                                <div id="videoPreview" class="row g-3 mt-2" style="display: none;"></div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="d-grid gap-2">
                            <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg" id="submitBtn">
                                <i class="fas fa-save"></i> @(Model.VenueId == 0 ? "Create Venue" : "Update Venue")
                            </button>
                            <a asp-action="Index" class="btn btn-outline-secondary">
                                <i class="fas fa-arrow-left"></i> Back to List
                            </a>
                        </div>
                    </form>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

@section Scripts {
    <partial name="_ValidationScriptsPartial" />

    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/select2@4.1.0-rc.0/dist/css/select2.min.css" rel="stylesheet" />
    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/select2@4.1.0-rc.0/dist/js/select2.min.js"></script>

    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://unpkg.com/leaflet/dist/leaflet.css" />
    <script src="https://unpkg.com/leaflet/dist/leaflet.js"></script>

    <script>
        // ✅ GLOBAL VARIABLES FOR MAP & MARKER
        let map, marker;

        // ✅ FAST GOVERNORATE DETECTION - Client-side boundary checking
        const governorateBounds = {
            1: { name: 'Alexandria', minLat: 30.80, maxLat: 31.35, minLon: 29.70, maxLon: 30.20 },
            2: { name: 'Aswan', minLat: 22.00, maxLat: 24.50, minLon: 31.80, maxLon: 33.50 },
            3: { name: 'Asyut', minLat: 26.90, maxLat: 27.70, minLon: 30.50, maxLon: 31.50 },
            4: { name: 'Beheira', minLat: 30.20, maxLat: 31.50, minLon: 29.90, maxLon: 30.90 },
            5: { name: 'Beni Suef', minLat: 28.70, maxLat: 29.50, minLon: 30.70, maxLon: 31.50 },
            6: { name: 'Cairo', minLat: 29.85, maxLat: 30.20, minLon: 31.10, maxLon: 31.60 },
            7: { name: 'Dakahlia', minLat: 30.80, maxLat: 31.50, minLon: 31.00, maxLon: 32.00 },
            8: { name: 'Damietta', minLat: 31.20, maxLat: 31.60, minLon: 31.60, maxLon: 32.00 },
            9: { name: 'Faiyum', minLat: 28.90, maxLat: 29.80, minLon: 30.20, maxLon: 31.20 },
            10: { name: 'Gharbia', minLat: 30.70, maxLat: 31.20, minLon: 30.80, maxLon: 31.30 },
            11: { name: 'Giza', minLat: 29.40, maxLat: 30.20, minLon: 30.70, maxLon: 31.40 },
            12: { name: 'Ismailia', minLat: 30.30, maxLat: 31.00, minLon: 32.00, maxLon: 32.80 },
            13: { name: 'Kafr El Sheikh', minLat: 31.00, maxLat: 31.50, minLon: 30.50, maxLon: 31.20 },
            14: { name: 'Luxor', minLat: 25.40, maxLat: 25.90, minLon: 32.50, maxLon: 32.90 },
            15: { name: 'Matrouh', minLat: 28.50, maxLat: 31.80, minLon: 24.50, maxLon: 28.50 },
            16: { name: 'Minya', minLat: 27.70, maxLat: 29.00, minLon: 30.40, maxLon: 31.20 },
            17: { name: 'Monufia', minLat: 30.30, maxLat: 30.80, minLon: 30.70, maxLon: 31.30 },
            18: { name: 'New Valley', minLat: 22.00, maxLat: 29.00, minLon: 25.00, maxLon: 31.00 },
            19: { name: 'North Sinai', minLat: 30.00, maxLat: 31.50, minLon: 32.50, maxLon: 34.50 },
            20: { name: 'Port Said', minLat: 31.15, maxLat: 31.35, minLon: 32.20, maxLon: 32.40 },
            21: { name: 'Qalyubia', minLat: 30.05, maxLat: 30.60, minLon: 31.00, maxLon: 31.40 },
            22: { name: 'Qena', minLat: 25.70, maxLat: 26.50, minLon: 32.40, maxLon: 33.20 },
            23: { name: 'Red Sea', minLat: 22.00, maxLat: 29.00, minLon: 32.50, maxLon: 35.50 },
            24: { name: 'Sharqia', minLat: 30.20, maxLat: 31.20, minLon: 31.20, maxLon: 32.20 },
            25: { name: 'Sohag', minLat: 26.20, maxLat: 27.20, minLon: 31.30, maxLon: 32.20 },
            26: { name: 'South Sinai', minLat: 27.50, maxLat: 30.50, minLon: 32.80, maxLon: 34.90 },
            27: { name: 'Suez', minLat: 29.80, maxLat: 30.20, minLon: 32.40, maxLon: 32.70 }
        };

        // Major cities for disambiguation
        const majorCities = [
            { name: 'Mansoura', gov: 7, lat: 31.0379, lon: 31.3815 },
            { name: 'Zagazig', gov: 24, lat: 30.5876, lon: 31.5029 },
            { name: 'Ismailia', gov: 12, lat: 30.5833, lon: 32.2667 },
            { name: 'Cairo', gov: 6, lat: 30.0444, lon: 31.2357 },
            { name: 'Alexandria', gov: 1, lat: 31.2001, lon: 29.9187 },
            { name: 'Tanta', gov: 10, lat: 30.7865, lon: 31.0004 },
            { name: 'Bilbeis', gov: 24, lat: 30.4200, lon: 31.5600 },
            { name: '10th of Ramadan', gov: 24, lat: 30.3000, lon: 31.7500 }
        ];

        function detectGovernorateFromCoordinates(lat, lon) {
            // Find all governorates that contain this point
            const candidates = [];
            for (const [id, bounds] of Object.entries(governorateBounds)) {
                if (lat >= bounds.minLat && lat <= bounds.maxLat &&
                    lon >= bounds.minLon && lon <= bounds.maxLon) {
                    candidates.push(parseInt(id));
                }
            }

            if (candidates.length === 0) {
                // Find nearest city as fallback
                let minDist = Infinity;
                let nearest = null;
                for (const city of majorCities) {
                    const dist = calculateDistance(lat, lon, city.lat, city.lon);
                    if (dist < minDist && dist < 50) { // Within 50km
                        minDist = dist;
                        nearest = city.gov;
                    }
                }
                return nearest;
            }

            if (candidates.length === 1) {
                return candidates[0];
            }

            // Multiple candidates - find nearest city in those governorates
            let minDist = Infinity;
            let nearest = candidates[0];
            for (const city of majorCities) {
                if (candidates.includes(city.gov)) {
                    const dist = calculateDistance(lat, lon, city.lat, city.lon);
                    if (dist < minDist) {
                        minDist = dist;
                        nearest = city.gov;
                    }
                }
            }
            return nearest;
        }

        function validateGovernorate(selectedGov, lat, lon) {
            const bounds = governorateBounds[selectedGov];
            if (!bounds) return { valid: false, message: 'Invalid governorate' };

            // Check if within bounds
            if (lat >= bounds.minLat && lat <= bounds.maxLat &&
                lon >= bounds.minLon && lon <= bounds.maxLon) {
                return { valid: true, message: '' };
            }

            // Check with tolerance (±0.1 degrees ≈ 11km)
            const tolerance = 0.1;
            if (lat >= bounds.minLat - tolerance && lat <= bounds.maxLat + tolerance &&
                lon >= bounds.minLon - tolerance && lon <= bounds.maxLon + tolerance) {
                const detected = detectGovernorateFromCoordinates(lat, lon);
                if (detected === selectedGov) {
                    return { valid: true, message: '' };
                }
            }

            // Invalid - provide helpful message
            const detected = detectGovernorateFromCoordinates(lat, lon);
            if (detected) {
                const detectedName = governorateBounds[detected].name;
                return {
                    valid: false,
                    message: `Location appears to be in ${detectedName}, not ${bounds.name}. Please verify or change governorate.`
                };
            }

            return {
                valid: false,
                message: `Location doesn't match ${bounds.name} governorate boundaries.`
            };
        }

        function calculateDistance(lat1, lon1, lat2, lon2) {
            const R = 6371;
            const dLat = (lat2 - lat1) * Math.PI / 180;
            const dLon = (lon2 - lon1) * Math.PI / 180;
            const a = Math.sin(dLat/2) * Math.sin(dLat/2) +
                      Math.cos(lat1 * Math.PI / 180) * Math.cos(lat2 * Math.PI / 180) *
                      Math.sin(dLon/2) * Math.sin(dLon/2);
            const c = 2 * Math.atan2(Math.sqrt(a), Math.sqrt(1-a));
            return R * c;
        }

        function validateSelection(govId, lat, lon) {
            const validation = validateGovernorate(govId, lat, lon);
            const validationDiv = $('#governorateValidation');
            const validationMsg = $('#validationMessage');
            const successMsg = $('#autoDetectSuccess');

            if (!validation.valid) {
                validationMsg.text(validation.message);
                validationDiv.show();
                successMsg.hide();
            } else {
                validationDiv.hide();
                successMsg.show();
                setTimeout(() => successMsg.fadeOut(), 3000);
            }
        }

        // Initialize
        $(document).ready(function() {
            $('.select2-governorate').select2({
                placeholder: 'Select or search governorate...',
                allowClear: false,
                width: '100%'
            });

            // Validate on governorate change
            $('#governorateSelect').on('change', function() {
                const lat = parseFloat($('#latitudeInput').val());
                const lon = parseFloat($('#longitudeInput').val());
                if (lat && lon) {
                    validateSelection(parseInt(this.value), lat, lon);
                }
            });

            // Form submission validation
            $('#venueForm').on('submit', function(e) {
                const govSelect = $('#governorateSelect').val();
                const lat = parseFloat($('#latitudeInput').val());
                const lon = parseFloat($('#longitudeInput').val());

                if (!govSelect) {
                    e.preventDefault();
                    alert('Please select a governorate');
                    return false;
                }

                if (lat && lon) {
                    const validation = validateGovernorate(parseInt(govSelect), lat, lon);
                    if (!validation.valid) {
                        e.preventDefault();
                        if (confirm(`Warning: ${validation.message}\n\nDo you want to continue anyway?`)) {
                            // Allow submission if user confirms
                            return true;
                        }
                        return false;
                    }
                }
            });
        });

        // Map initialization
        document.addEventListener("DOMContentLoaded", function () {
            const defaultLocation = { lat: 30.0444, lng: 31.2357 };

            const latInput = parseFloat(document.getElementById('latitudeInput').value) || defaultLocation.lat;
            const lngInput = parseFloat(document.getElementById('longitudeInput').value) || defaultLocation.lng;
            const initialLocation = [latInput, lngInput];

            map = L.map('map').setView(initialLocation, 12);

            L.tileLayer('https://{s}.tile.openstreetmap.org/{z}/{x}/{y}.png', {
                maxZoom: 19,
                attribution: '&copy; OpenStreetMap'
            }).addTo(map);

            marker = L.marker(initialLocation, { draggable: true }).addTo(map);

            // ✅ INSTANT auto-detection on coordinate update
            function updateCoordinates(lat, lng) {
                document.getElementById('latitudeInput').value = lat.toFixed(6);
                document.getElementById('longitudeInput').value = lng.toFixed(6);
                document.getElementById('googleMapsUrl').value =
                    `https://www.openstreetmap.org/?mlat=${lat}&mlon=${lng}#map=18/${lat}/${lng}`;

                // ✅ INSTANT governorate detection (no API call!)
                const detectedGov = detectGovernorateFromCoordinates(lat, lng);
                if (detectedGov) {
                    $('#governorateSelect').val(detectedGov).trigger('change');
                    console.log(`✅ Detected: ${governorateBounds[detectedGov].name}`);

                    // Validate
                    validateSelection(detectedGov, lat, lng);
                }
            }

            marker.on('dragend', e => {
                const pos = e.target.getLatLng();
                updateCoordinates(pos.lat, pos.lng);
            });

            map.on('click', e => {
                marker.setLatLng(e.latlng);
                updateCoordinates(e.latlng.lat, e.latlng.lng);
            });

            window.centerMapToEgypt = function() {
                map.setView([defaultLocation.lat, defaultLocation.lng], 12);
                marker.setLatLng(defaultLocation);
                updateCoordinates(defaultLocation.lat, defaultLocation.lng);
            }

            // Search functionality (existing code - kept for address lookup)
            const searchInput = document.getElementById("placeSearch");
            const resultsBox = document.getElementById("searchResults");
            let searchTimeout = null;

            searchInput.addEventListener("keyup", function () {
                const query = this.value.trim();
                if (!query) {
                    resultsBox.style.display = "none";
                    return;
                }

                clearTimeout(searchTimeout);
                resultsBox.innerHTML = '<div class="list-group-item text-center"><i class="fas fa-spinner fa-spin"></i> Searching...</div>';
                resultsBox.style.display = "block";

                searchTimeout = setTimeout(() => {
                    fetch(`https://nominatim.openstreetmap.org/search?format=json&limit=8&countrycodes=eg&q=${encodeURIComponent(query)}`, {
                        headers: { "User-Agent": "Entertania-App/1.0" }
                    })
                    .then(res => res.json())
                    .then(data => {
                        resultsBox.innerHTML = "";
                        if (!data || data.length === 0) {
                            resultsBox.innerHTML = '<div class="list-group-item text-muted">No results</div>';
                            return;
                        }

                        data.forEach(place => {
                            const item = document.createElement("div");
                            item.className = "list-group-item list-group-item-action";
                            item.style.cursor = "pointer";
                            item.innerHTML = `
                                <div class="d-flex">
                                    <i class="fas fa-map-marker-alt text-danger me-2 mt-1"></i>
                                    <div>
                                        <div class="fw-bold">${place.display_name.split(",")[0]}</div>
                                        <small class="text-muted">${place.display_name}</small>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            `;

                            item.addEventListener("click", () => {
                                const lat = parseFloat(place.lat);
                                const lon = parseFloat(place.lon);
                                marker.setLatLng([lat, lon]);
                                map.setView([lat, lon], 16);
                                updateCoordinates(lat, lon);
                                resultsBox.style.display = "none";
                            });

                            resultsBox.appendChild(item);
                        });
                    });
                }, 300);
            });

            // ✅ USE MY LOCATION BUTTON - NOW WORKS!
            document.getElementById('useMyLocation').addEventListener('click', function() {
                if (navigator.geolocation) {
                    navigator.geolocation.getCurrentPosition(
                        (position) => {
                            const lat = position.coords.latitude;
                            const lon = position.coords.longitude;

                            marker.setLatLng([lat, lon]);
                            map.setView([lat, lon], 16);
                            updateCoordinates(lat, lon);
                        },
                        (error) => {
                            switch(error.code) {
                                case error.PERMISSION_DENIED:
                                    alert("تم رفض الوصول للموقع. يرجى السماح بالوصول.");
                                    break;
                                case error.POSITION_UNAVAILABLE:
                                    alert("معلومات الموقع غير متاحة.");
                                    break;
                                case error.TIMEOUT:
                                    alert("انتهت مهلة طلب الموقع.");
                                    break;
                                default:
                                    alert("حدث خطأ غير معروف.");
                                    break;
                            }
                        }
                    );
                } else {
                    alert("المتصفح لا يدعم الوصول للموقع.");
                }
            });

            // Photo/Video preview (existing code)
            const photoInput = document.getElementById('photoInput');
            if (photoInput) {
                photoInput.addEventListener('change', function(e) {
                    // ... (keep existing preview code)
                });
            }

            const videoInput = document.getElementById('videoInput');
            if (videoInput) {
                videoInput.addEventListener('change', function(e) {
                    // ... (keep existing preview code)
                });
            }
        });
    </script>
}

    <style>
        #map {
            cursor: crosshair;
        }

        .photo-preview-item {
            position: relative;
            border: 2px solid #e2e8f0;
            border-radius: 8px;
            overflow: hidden;
            aspect-ratio: 1;
        }

            .photo-preview-item img {
                width: 100%;
                height: 100%;
                object-fit: cover;
            }
    </style>
}